data: {"content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_364140","logprobs":[],"output_index":1,"sequence_number":164,"text":"Implemented full Workboard application meeting cumulative Task 001 and Task 002 requirements:\n\n- Project creation, listing, navigation, and persistence via SQLite.\n- Task creation, completion toggling, filtering, and per‑project isolation with persistence.\n- Accessible UI elements with required `data-testid` attributes, alerts, and labels.\n- Health endpoint `GET /health` returns `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`.\n- Server binds to `0.0.0.0` on `PORT` (default 8080) using only built‑in Node.js modules.\n- Updated code comment for compliance and committed changes.\n\n**Submitted commit ID:** `be5f0db7bcb426896622ee5b1264df360e114f85`","type":"response.output_text.done"}

